<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Good Time</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Dare</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">What's Wrong With New York?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5OHOxbQzqdwH2wzYvUNL3u</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.260" end="00:08.760">Ow!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.280" end="00:11.060">Let's have some fun tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.060" end="00:12.560">Ow!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.690" end="00:14.570">Let's have some fun tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.570" end="00:17.150">Yeah I might start a fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.150" end="00:21.580">'Cause we're all on the brink of suicide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.580" end="00:24.540">Oh come on, let's turn the lights down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.540" end="00:28.720">Oh come on, let's turn the lights down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.720" end="00:31.920">Oh come on, let's turn the lights out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.920" end="00:34.980">Can't bear to see this place when the sun's out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.980" end="00:38.270">Touch me, then say you need me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.270" end="00:43.440">Fuck me, like we were meant to be, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.440" end="00:45.260">I got no money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.260" end="00:46.760">You got no money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.550" end="00:48.740">We got a good time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.740" end="00:50.240">Ow!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.100" end="00:52.560">Coming in from all sides</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.560" end="00:56.010">I'm in the city while you're online</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.010" end="00:59.470">I'm in the club while you're online</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.470" end="01:02.730">Hope my set sounds good outside baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.730" end="01:06.180">Touch me, then say you need me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.180" end="01:11.210">Fuck me, like we were meant to be, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.210" end="01:13.040">I got no money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.040" end="01:14.720">You got no money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.720" end="01:16.610">We got a good time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.610" end="01:20.160">Touch me, then say you need me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.160" end="01:25.260">Fuck me, like we were meant to be, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.260" end="01:26.760">I got no money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.750" end="01:28.250">You got no money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.210" end="01:36.210">We got a good time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.530" end="01:54.530" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.470" end="02:01.920">Touch me, then say you need me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.920" end="02:06.990">Fuck me, like we were meant to be, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.990" end="02:08.740">I got no money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.740" end="02:10.420">You got no money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.420" end="02:12.310">We got a good time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.310" end="02:16.310" /></div></body></tt>